### What this file does

| Section | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| **Imports & annotations** | Brings in Runelite classes, the config interface, the shared API clients, and SLF4J logging. |
| **Plugin metadata** (`@PluginDescriptor`) | Declares the plugin name, description, and tags – required for the Runelite hub. |
| **Field injection** | `@Inject` wires `Client`, `RivalRadarConfig`, `OverlayManager`, and `Notifier` into the plugin. |
| **`rivalXPCache` & `lastRefresh`** | Simple holder for cached rival XP and the timestamp of the last refresh. |
| **`@Provides` method** | Supplies the config instance to the plugin. |
| **Lifecycle (`startUp` / `shutdown`)** | Loads the overlay once, refreshes rivals, and cleans up on shutdown. |
| **Event listeners** | • `onChatMessage` – handles `!rival <name>` commands.<br>• `onGameTick` – auto‑refreshes rivals based on the interval. |
| **Core logic** | • `refreshRivals()` – parses the CSV of rival names and fetches their XP.<br>• `get7DayXP()` – averages results from the two public APIs.<br>• `compareWithRival()` – calculates the delta and triggers a notification when the threshold is exceeded.<br>• `calculateXP()` – returns the local player’s XP. |
| **Public accessors** | `getLocalPlayerName()`, `getLocalPlayerXP()`, `getRivalXPCache()` – expose data to the overlay without exposing the internal map directly. |
| **Overlay class (`RivalRadarOverlay`)** | Draws a simple top‑left panel showing: <br>• Your name & XP.<br>• Each rival’s name & XP.<br>• The numeric delta (green if ahead, red if behind). |
| **Regex parser** | `parseXPFromResponse()` extracts the numeric XP value from the raw API JSON string without needing a full JSON library. |

